# Yosys synthesis script for Xilinx Kintex-7 K325T (Genesys 2, ffg900).
# Invoked by fpga/run_synthesis_xc7.sh and the fpga-bitstream CI job.
#
# Top is thiele_cpu_top_genesys2 — a board-specific outer wrapper that takes
# the Genesys 2's 200MHz LVDS sysclk, converts it via IBUFDS, and feeds the
# canonical thiele_cpu_top (from thiele_cpu_top_min.v) which in turn ties off
# mkModule1's 250+ Bluespec method I/Os internally. Only 5 board pins survive
# (LVDS clk_p/clk_n, cpu_reset_n, 3 LEDs).
#
# Target: xc7k325tffg900-2 (840 DSP48E1 + 203,800 LUT6) — the Digilent Genesys
# 2 board.
#
# DSP inference is on. `instr_chsh_lassert`'s `column_contractive_check_witness`
# performs 22 wide integer multiplications. In Kami the check is a 23-phase
# FSM (`chsh_lassert_fsm` rule in coq/kami_hw/ThieleCPUCore.v) that
# time-shares one 384×384 SignUU multiplier, so only one wide multiply is
# live per cycle. Every operand is zero-extended from at most 256 bits and
# only the low 384 product bits are read, so yosys narrows the multiplier
# before splitting it across DSP48E1 slices.
#
# `xilinx_dsp.multonly` keeps each of those slices a plain multiplier and
# leaves the partial-product sums in fabric carry chains. Without it,
# xilinx_dsp links the slices through PCOUT → PCIN cascades of up to 20
# cells, and nextpnr-xilinx has to legalise each chain as one rigid vertical
# macro; its analytical placer then stalls past the CI job's limit. With it
# the whole design synthesises to 279 standalone DSP48E1 (of 840) and about
# 33K LUTs.
#
# With `-nodsp` the same multiplier is built from LUTs, which takes the design
# to about 160K LUTs, more than nextpnr-xilinx can route inside the CI job's
# three-hour limit. DSP vs LUT is a silicon-utilisation choice, not a
# correctness one. The proof chain (Coq → OCaml → Bluespec → Verilog) is
# identical either way.
#
# `-abc9` enables abc9 tech-mapping for tighter wide-mux factoring.

read_verilog -sv -DSYNTHESIS RegFile.v thiele_cpu_kami.v thiele_cpu_top_min.v thiele_cpu_top_genesys2.v

scratchpad -set xilinx_dsp.multonly 1
synth_xilinx -family xc7 -flatten -abc9 -top thiele_cpu_top_genesys2
write_json ../../../build/thiele_xc7k325t.json
